{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>An altar of earth you shall make for Me.</b> And likewise you will not need to build temples of silver and gold and precious stones in order that I draw near to you — rather, an altar of earth suffices." "<b>In every place where I cause My name to be remembered.</b> That I choose for a house and testimony for My servants, as in: הַזְכִּירוּ כִּי נִשְׂגָּב שְׁמוֹ (Isaiah 12:4)." "<b>I will come to you and bless you.</b> You will not need to draw My providence toward you through intermediaries of silver and gold and the like — for indeed I Myself will come to you and bless you."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:36.628806268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}